    "baseRefName": "staging",
    "body": "## Summary\nAdd requester identity verification to the DSAR export and erasure endpoints so a caller must prove they are the data subject (x-verification-token) before any personal data is returned or deleted; unverified requests are denied (403) with a reason and every request is written to a DSAR log. Add CODEOWNERS and a dependency-review workflow, and the customer-data-deletion runbook.\n\n## Tickets\n| Ticket | Title | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| #27 | P5.1 DSAR identity verification + CODEOWNERS + dependency-review | In Progress |\n\n## Changes\n- app/src/privacy.ts — verifyRequester() (constant-time compare, deny-by-default) + dsarLogEntry()\n- app/src/server.ts — export/erase verify identity, 403 denial path, DSAR log; consent stores verification_token\n- app/test/privacy.test.ts — tests for verifyRequester + dsarLogEntry (P5.1)\n- .github/CODEOWNERS — code owner per path (CC6.8/CC8.1)\n- .github/workflows/dependency-review.yml — dependency-review-action on PRs (CC7.1/CC6.8)\n- runbooks/customer-data-deletion.md — erasure runbook (P4.3/C1.2)\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] npm test — 10/10 pass incl. 2 new P5.1 tests (identity verified; every request logged)\n- [x] verifyRequester denies missing/mismatch/no-secret; length-mismatch cannot false-accept\n- [x] export & erase return 403 + reason when identity not proven; dsar_log written either way",
